d":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-04-09T16:40:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T23:18:15Z","closed_at":"2025-04-09T23:18:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.dev.custom_build [4248411ba]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (4248411ba) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12033.1030) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-12100F (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen `Dictionary` validates the key type passed in, the type may be changed to match the container type.  In most cases, the validated type is used, but `Dictionary::has` uses the original passed in type, which may cause it to not find the key in the `HashMap`.  I think this only impacts dictionaries with `float` keys, when calling `has` with an `int` - `String`/`StringName` differences seem to be handled by `StringLikeVariantComparator`.\n\nExample gdscript:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar d : Dictionary[float, String] = {}\n\td[1] = \"value\"\n\tprint(d.has(1))\n\tprint(d.has_all([1]))\n\tprint(d[1])\n\tprint(d)\n```\n\nOutput:\n```\nfalse\ntrue\nvalue\n{ 1.0: \"value\" }\n```\n\nExpected:\n```\ntrue\ntrue\nvalue\n{ 1.0: \"value\" }\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a `Dictionary` with `float` key type, add a whole number key, then call `has` with the key as an `int`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A, can be reproduced in new project with gdscript above","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://